Project Title: BrandoraX – Full-Stack Online Retail & Clothing Platform

Project Category: Full-Stack Web Application Development

Project Description:
BrandoraX is a full-stack e-commerce web application independently developed as an online retail and clothing platform. Built using React.js, Node.js, Express.js, and MySQL, the system features a responsive user interface, RESTful APIs, secure user authentication, protected routes, and optimized database operations. It incorporates bcrypt password hashing, SQL injection prevention, and relational database design to provide a secure, efficient, and maintainable shopping platform.

